Use a minimal SaaS color palette.

Primary color:

```text
#6366F1
```

Primary hover:

```text
#5558E8
```

Primary foreground:

```text
#FFFFFF
```

Background:

```text
#FAFAFA
```

Surface / card background:

```text
#FFFFFF
```

Muted surface:

```text
#F5F5F5
```

Border:

```text
#E5E7EB
```

Primary text:

```text
#111827
```

Secondary text:

```text
#6B7280
```

Muted text:

```text
#9CA3AF
```

Success:

```text
#22C55E
```

Warning:

```text
#F59E0B
```

Danger:

```text
